# Commit message template
# 
# Format:
# <type>: <subject>
# 
# <body>
# 
# Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, perf, ci, build, revert
# 
# Guidelines:
# - Subject: Imperative mood ("add feature" not "added feature")
# - Body: Explain WHAT changed and WHY
# - NO AI attribution, provider names, model names, or tool references
# - NO Co-authored-by, Generated-by, or similar trailers
# - Focus on technical changes only
